{"title":"Virikh Dragonslayer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>57</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>34</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>58</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>57</td><td>in the wilds around 2154, 405</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>34</td><td>in the wilds around 2149, 407</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"virikh-dragonslayer\" data-map-level=\"58\">Show level 58 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1417.6px,-1078.1px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/5/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/5/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:1446.5px;top:1045.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1439.9px;top:1076.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1439.1px;top:1046.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1409.4px;top:1087.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1445.3px;top:1079.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1437.1px;top:1030.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1419.6px;top:1001.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1395.2px;top:1060.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1441.9px;top:1085.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1434.4px;top:1083.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1420.2px;top:1088.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1422.3px;top:1011.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1393.2px;top:1076.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1433.1px;top:1090.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1433.0px;top:1063.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1450.7px;top:1072.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1397.3px;top:1070.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1434.6px;top:1044.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1435.1px;top:1029.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1410.1px;top:1083.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1445.9px;top:1036.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1426.2px;top:1093.9px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2149, 409 <span class=\"muted\">· 17 spots</span></li><li>in the w